    4. Usually place a full-spanning divider line in a non-src, non-bg color between the legend/table region and the scattered-object region
    5. Scatter target objects (single pixels or small monochromatic blobs) on the opposite side of any divider; use a mix of src colors that include multi-step chain starts and non-src colors that stay unchanged
    6. Verify legend is the unique connected 2-col fully-filled component with >=3 colors
